</p> <!-- Two Rooms Navigation Switcher --> <div class="flex items-center justify-center gap-3 pt-4"> <button id="btn-room-read" type="button" class="room-tab-btn px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl font-sans text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold transition-all duration-300 flex items-center gap-2 shadow-xs bg-paper-accent text-white"> <span>📖</span> <span>১. পড়া শেষ বইসমূহ</span> <span id="read-count-badge" class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs bg-white/20 text-white font-mono"> 3 </span> </button> <button id="btn-room-wish" type="button" class="room-tab-btn px-5 py-2.5 rounded-xl font-sans text-xs sm:text-sm font-semibold transition-all duration-300 flex items-center gap-2 border border-paper-border dark:border-night-border bg-paper-surface/60 dark:bg-night-surface/60 text-paper-muted dark:text-night-muted hover:text-paper-text"> <span>🎯</span> <span>২. পড়ার তালিকায় (উইশলিস্ট)</span> <span id="wish-count-badge" class="px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full text-xs bg-paper-border dark:bg-night-border font-mono"> 4 </span> </button> </div> </header> <!-- ROOM 1: পড়া শেষ বইসমূহ (Finished Books Grid) --> <section id="room-read" class="space-y-6"> <div class="flex items-center justify-between pb-3 border-b border-paper-border/60 dark:border-night-border/60"> <div> <h2 class="text-xl font-bold font-serif text-paper-text dark:text-night-text flex items-center gap-2"> <span>✨</span> <span>পঠিত বই ও পাঠপ্রতিক্রিয়া</span> </h2> <p class="text-xs text-paper-muted dark:text-night-muted font-sans mt-0.5">
